#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versioon"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Looge alglaetav USB-seade lihtsalt"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Muuda keelt:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Soovite seda tõlget parandada?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus on utiliit, mis abistab alglaaditavate USB seadmete (mälupulgad, "
"mälukaardid jne) loomisel ja vormindamisel."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "See võib olla iseäranis kasulik siis kui:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"soovite luua USB-paigaldusmeediat alglaaditavatest ISO-failidest (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, jne.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "soovite töötada arvutiga, millel puudub operatsoonisüsteem"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "soovite uuendada BIOSi või mõnda muud püsivara DOSis"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "soovite kasutada mõnd madaltaseme utiliiti"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Väikesest mahust hoolimata annab Rufus kasutajale kõik vajalikud võimalused!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Rufuse poolt toetatavate ISO failide osaline nimekiri asub lehekülje "
"allosas."

