msgstr "Nõuded süsteemile:"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 või uuem."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Tarkvara on peale allalaadimist kohe kasutusvalmis."

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Toetatud keeled:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Kasutan siinkohal võimalust avaldada tänu kõikidele tõlkijatele, kes on "
"teinud võimalikuks Rufuse ja selle veebilehe tõlked paljudesse keeltesse. "
"Kui saad Rufust kasutada oma emakeeles, peaksid tõesti neid tänama!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Kasutamine"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Laadige alla ja käivitage fail &ndash; eraldi paigaldamine pole vajalik."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"Käivitusfail on digitaalselt allkirjastatud ning allkirjastajaks peab olema:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 või hilisem)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 või varasem)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Märkused DOSi toe kohta:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Kui loote DOS alglaadimisketast ja soovite kasutada muud "
"klaviatuuripaigutust peale ameerika (US), proovib Rufus leida "
"klaviatuuripaigutust, mis vastab teie süsteemi sätetele."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Märkused ISO failide toe kohta:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Rufuse versioonid alates v1.1.0 võimaldavad luua alglaetavaid USB-seadmeid "
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO tõmmisest</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"ISO tõmmise loomine füüsilisest kettast või failide kogumist on väga lihtne,"
" kasutades CD kirjutamise tarkvara nagu vabalt kättesaadavad <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> või <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Korduma Kippuvad Küsimused (KKK)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Rufust puudutavad korduma kippuvad küsimused ja nende (KKK) on saadaval "
"<b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>siin</a></b> (inglise keeles)."

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Et kindlustada tagasisidet tekkinud tarkvaravea kohta või soovid programmi "
"täiustamist, palume kasutada <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. või "
"võid saata <a target=\"_blank\" %s>e.kirja e-mail</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Litsents"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) versioon 3</a> või "
"hilisem."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Teil on vabadus seda tarkvara levitada, muuta ja isegi müüa, kuni olete "
"kooskõlas GPLv3 litsentsiga."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus on loodud 100%% avatult, selle <a target=\"_blank\" %s> avalikust "
"allikast </a>, kasutades <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> keskkonda."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Muudatused (inglise keeles)"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Lähtekood"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Alternatiivina võite kloonida <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> andmeladu, "
"kasutades:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr "Lisateavet leiate <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub projektist</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Kui oled arendaja, oled teretulnud Rufuse kallal nokitsema ning parandusi ja"
" täiendusi esitama."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Annetused"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Kuna seda alailma küsitakse, siis olgu öeldud, et sellel lehel <b>ei</b> ole"
" annetusnuppu."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Peamine põhjus on see, et ma tunnen, et annetamise süsteem ei aita "
"tegelikult tarkvara arendamisele kaasa ja mis veel hullem, tekitab süütunnet"
" kasutajates, kes on otsustanud mitte annetada."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Kui te tõesti soovite, siis on alati võimalik teha annetus <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation'ile</a>, sest nemad on peamine"
" põhjus, miks tarkvara nagu Rufus on üleüldse võimalik."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Kasutan võimalust, ütlemaks <i><u>suur aitäh</u></i> teie jätkuva toe ja "
"entusiasmi eest sellele pisikesele programmile. Ma pean sellest tõesti lugu!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Nii et jätkake aga julgelt Rufuse kasutamist ilma igasuguse süütundeta selle"
" rahaliselt mitte toetamise eest &ndash; selleks pole tõesti põhjust!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Mittetäielik loetelu ISOdest, millega Rufus teadaolevalt töötab"

